    "text": "a) Do there exist elements u, v of a 2-generator free group F (a, b) such that\nu, v are not conjugate in F (a, b) but for any matrices A, B ∈ GL(3, C) we have\ntrace(u(A, B)) = trace(v(A, B))?\n    b) The same question if we replace GL(3, C) by SL(3, C).              I. Kapovich",
